      #|[issue201] <|citation-number>{2 }</> | <|names><|name:0>{cfr42}</></>{. }<|text>{Use of ids field creates unstable references}</>{ [Internet]. }<|date>{2014 Feb}</>{Available from: }<|text>[https://github.com/plk/biblatex/issues/201](https://github.com/plk/biblatex/issues/201)</>
      #|[arrgh] <|citation-number>{3 }</> | <|names><|name:0>{Leeson PT}</></>{. }<|text>{The Pirate Organization}</>
      #|[quark] <|citation-number>{4 }</> | <|names><|name:0>{Leeson PT}</></>{. }<|text>{The Quark Organization}</>
