      #|[sharing] - | <|names><|name:0>{Kopp J}</>{, }<|name:1>{Gerike R}</>{, }<|name:2>{Axhausen KW}</></>{ }<|date>{(2015)}</>{ }<|text>{Do sharing people behave differently? An empirical evaluation of the distinctive mobility patterns of free-floating car-sharing members}</>{. }<|text>{Transportation}</>{ }<|text>{42}</>{:}<|text>{449–469}</>
